---
import { products } from '@kedoupi/shared/products';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import ProductList from './ProductList.astro';
---
<section class="personal-hero" aria-labelledby="home-heading">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1 id="home-heading"><span>把生活里的事，</span><span>慢慢做成自己的东西。</span></h1>
    <p>我是 kedoupi（codepi）。这里是我的个人数字空间，<br class="desktop-break" />连接健康、投资、内容工作，以及持续积累的思考。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="kdp-button" href="#applications">探索我的应用</a>
      <a class="kdp-button kdp-button--secondary" href="/about/">关于这个空间</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="personal-map" aria-label="个人数字空间连接健康、投资理财与公众号应用">
    <svg class="map-lines" viewBox="0 0 420 300" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M172 150C222 150 212 48 274 48M172 150H274M172 150C222 150 212 252 274 252" />
      <circle cx="274" cy="48" r="4" /><circle cx="274" cy="150" r="4" /><circle cx="274" cy="252" r="4" />
    </svg>
    <div class="map-person">
      <span class="kdp-mark" aria-hidden="true">k</span>
      <div><strong>kedoupi</strong><span>个人数字空间</span></div>
    </div>
    {products.map((product) => (
      <a class={`map-domain map-domain--${product.id}`} href={`/apps/#${product.id}`}>
        <Icon name={product.icon} size={25} /><span>{product.shortName}</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<aside class="current-note" aria-label="最近在做">
  <div class="current-label"><Icon name="calendar" size={20} /><strong>最近在做</strong></div>
  <p>整理自己的数字空间，让应用、知识与 AI 慢慢连接起来。</p>
  <time datetime="2026-10-15">2026.10.15</time>
</aside>

<section id="applications" class="applications" aria-labelledby="apps-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="apps-heading">从生活出发的应用</h2>
    <p>为自己做，也持续使用。</p>
  </div>
  <ProductList />
</section>

<section class="next-chapter" aria-label="记录与连接">
  <article class="chapter chapter--writing">
    <h2>记录，也是一种积累。</h2>
    <p>文章和笔记，会逐渐在这里生长。先把真实的想法留下来，再慢慢整理。</p>
    <div class="chapter-status"><Icon name="writing" size={24} /><span>博客与笔记正在整理中</span></div>
  </article>
  <article class="chapter chapter--ai">
    <h2>与 AI 连接</h2>
    <p>让公开的内容被找到，让个人记录在授权下被理解。</p>
    <div class="chapter-status"><Icon name="network" size={26} /><span>MCP · 逐步建设</span></div>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="blog-teaser" aria-label="博客">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>最近写下来的东西</h2>
    <p>整理完成的公开表达，陆续更新。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="blog-teaser-body">
    <p>博客已经开放。开始写作后，这里会展示最近的文章。</p>
    <a class="kdp-button kdp-button--secondary" href="/blog/">进入博客</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .personal-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.45fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 28px; padding-block: 60px 64px; }
  h1 { margin: 0; color: var(--kdp-ink); font-size: clamp(34px, 3.55vw, 50px); font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  h1 span { display: block; }
  .hero-copy > p { margin: 22px 0 0; color: var(--kdp-text); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; margin-top: 30px; }
  .personal-map { position: relative; height: 300px; width: 100%; max-width: 420px; justify-self: end; }
  .map-lines { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }
  .map-lines path { stroke: var(--kdp-line-strong); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .map-lines circle { fill: var(--brand-orange); }
  .map-person, .map-domain { position: absolute; display: flex; align-items: center; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--kdp-line); box-shadow: var(--kdp-shadow); }
  .map-person { top: 108px; left: 0; gap: 14px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 19px; }
  .map-person strong { display: block; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; }
  .map-person div > span { display: block; margin-top: 3px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--kdp-muted); }
  .map-domain { left: 69%; width: 31%; min-width: 116px; height: 62px; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; border-radius: 14px; color: var(--kdp-accent); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color var(--kdp-motion); }
  .map-domain span { color: var(--kdp-ink); }
  .map-domain:hover { border-color: var(--kdp-accent); }
  .map-domain--health { top: 17px; }
  .map-domain--gu { top: 119px; }
  .map-domain--wechat { top: 221px; }
  .current-note { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; min-height: 68px; padding: 18px 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--kdp-line); color: var(--kdp-muted); }
  .current-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding-right: 28px; border-right: 1px solid var(--kdp-line); flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 14px; }
  .current-label strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .current-note p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .current-note time { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .applications { padding-top: 46px; }
  .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--kdp-ink); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .section-heading p { margin: 0; color: var(--kdp-muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .next-chapter { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.55fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .chapter { padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--kdp-radius-lg); background: white; }
  .chapter--ai { background: var(--kdp-accent-soft); }
  .chapter > p { min-height: 52px; margin: 14px 0 22px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--kdp-text); }
  .chapter-status { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--kdp-line); font-size: 13px; color: var(--kdp-muted); }
  .blog-teaser { margin-top: 40px; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--kdp-line); border-radius: var(--kdp-radius-lg); background: var(--kdp-surface); box-shadow: var(--kdp-shadow); }
  .blog-teaser .section-heading { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .blog-teaser-body { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
  .blog-teaser-body p { margin: 0; color: var(--kdp-text); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
  @media (min-width: 721px) and (max-width: 1050px) {
    .personal-hero { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    h1 { font-size: 34px; }
    .hero-copy > p { font-size: 15px; }
    .desktop-break { display: none; }
    .map-person { gap: 8px; padding: 14px 12px; }
    .map-person strong { font-size: 15px; }
    .map-person .kdp-mark { width: 28px; height: 28px; font-size: 23px; }
    .map-domain { min-width: 96px; left: 67%; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .personal-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-block: 32px 28px; gap: 26px; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(27px, 6.8vw, 42px); line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
    .hero-copy > p { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 15px; }
    .desktop-break { display: none; }
    .hero-actions { gap: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .hero-actions .kdp-button { padding-inline: 18px; font-size: 14px; }
    .personal-map { max-width: 390px; justify-self: center; height: 260px; }
    .map-person { top: 91px; padding: 16px 12px; gap: 10px; }
    .map-domain { height: 56px; font-size: 13px; gap: 8px; min-width: 105px; left: 68%; }
    .map-domain--health { top: 14px; }
    .map-domain--gu { top: 102px; }
    .map-domain--wechat { top: 190px; }
    .current-note { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 10px 16px; padding-block: 20px; }
    .current-label { padding: 0; border: 0; font-size: 13px; gap: 10px; }
    .current-note p { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 2; }
    .current-note time { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
    .applications { padding-top: 32px; }
    .section-heading { display: block; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    h2 { font-size: 25px; }
    .section-heading p { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
    .next-chapter { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .chapter { padding: 24px; }
    .chapter > p { min-height: 0; }
    .blog-teaser { margin-top: 28px; padding: 24px; }
    .blog-teaser-body { align-items: flex-start; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 360px) {
    .map-person strong { font-size: 15px; }
    .map-person .kdp-mark { width: 28px; height: 28px; font-size: 23px; }
    .map-person { gap: 8px; padding-inline: 10px; }
    .map-domain { min-width: 95px; gap: 6px; left: 66%; }
  }
</style>
